<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - American Express started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - American Express started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Nomura equity research said it initiated coverage of American Express Co with a buy rating, saying strong card revenues should drive the company's top-line growth.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-month price target of $78.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 7/8 at 64-5/8.</p>
</text>
